### Test the API from VS Code (install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request" above each block)
@base = http://localhost:5080

### 1. Login (run this first)
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "pramodi", "password": "Password@123" }

### 2. List flights
GET {{base}}/api/flights
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 3. Add one flight
POST {{base}}/api/flights
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flightNo": "UL141", "from": "CMB", "to": "DEL", "pax": 210, "std": "2026-10-12T06:45:00", "etd": "2026-10-12T07:30:00" }

### 4. Add many flights at once
POST {{base}}/api/flights/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

[
  { "flightNo": "UL207", "from": "CMB", "to": "DOH", "pax": 230, "std": "2026-10-12T22:10:00", "etd": "2026-10-13T00:00:00" },
  { "flightNo": "UL503", "from": "CMB", "to": "MAA", "pax": 150, "std": "2026-10-13T13:30:00", "etd": "2026-10-13T14:15:00" }
]

### 5. Change a flight (replace 1 with the flight id)
PUT {{base}}/api/flights/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "flightNo": "UL225", "from": "CMB", "to": "DXB", "pax": 250, "std": "2026-10-10T18:40:00", "etd": "2026-10-10T21:50:00" }

### 6. Hide a flight
DELETE {{base}}/api/flights/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### ---------------- USERS (Admin only) ----------------

### 7. List users
GET {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 8. Add a user (password is hashed automatically; min 8 characters; role = Employee or Admin)
POST {{base}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "nimal", "displayName": "Nimal Perera", "employeeNo": "HR1001", "role": "Employee", "password": "Welcome@123" }

### 9. Change a user (replace 2 with the user id)
PUT {{base}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "displayName": "Nimal Perera", "employeeNo": "HR1001", "role": "Employee", "isActive": true }

### 10. Reset a user's password
POST {{base}}/api/users/2/reset-password
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "password": "NewPass@456" }

### 11. Deactivate a user
DELETE {{base}}/api/users/2
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### ---------------- MEAL REQUESTS (Admin: all users) ----------------

### 12. List all meal requests (optional ?userId=1&flightId=2)
GET {{base}}/api/admin/meal-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### 13. Add a meal request for a user (status: Pending, Approved, Issued or Rejected)
POST {{base}}/api/admin/meal-requests
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": 1, "flightId": 1, "mealsRequired": 150, "mealsIssued": 0, "mealType": "Lunch", "reason": "Flight Delay", "status": "Pending" }

### 14. Change a meal request (replace 1 with the request id)
PUT {{base}}/api/admin/meal-requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mealsRequired": 150, "mealsIssued": 110, "mealType": "Lunch", "reason": "Flight Delay", "status": "Issued" }

### 15. Delete a meal request
DELETE {{base}}/api/admin/meal-requests/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}
